    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Welcome to Watanos!</h2><br>A c\u0336\u0304\u032do\u0336\u035d\u0323m\u0337\u0302\u031dp\u0335\u0301\u0349l\u0336\u0302\u035ae\u0335\u033d\u0325t\u0335\u0302\u0355e\u0334\u0351\u031dl\u0335\u035b\u034ey\u0338\u030c\u032e \u0337\u035d\u0321n\u0335\u0303\u0345o\u0337\u0352\u0326r\u0336\u033d\u0324m\u0337\u030c\u0327a\u0335\u033d\u033cl\u0336\u0307\u0339 operating system, for all your mistery-solving needs! Browse the web, read their source code and download any resource you find interesting to unveil the secrets within. It's Cicada3301-style puzzle galore!<br><br>WatanOS is a puzzle sandbox game that puts you behind a computer screen, on your own fake Operating System made for cryptic enthusiasts. Explore the web with the sole purpose of trying to figure out all the misteries within it!<br><br>With several &quot;puzzle hubs&quot;, you'll find multiple places to satisfy your puzzle-solving needs.<br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Text encryption? We got you.<br></li><li> Image editing? We got you.<br></li><li> Analyzing fake HTML code to find hidden messages? We got you.<br></li><li> Audio and Video playing tools? We got you.</li></ul><br>Mind-bending puzzles that require outside-the-box thinking? That's what we do, baby!",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Welcome to Watanos!</h2><br>A c\u0336\u0304\u032do\u0336\u035d\u0323m\u0337\u0302\u031dp\u0335\u0301\u0349l\u0336\u0302\u035ae\u0335\u033d\u0325t\u0335\u0302\u0355e\u0334\u0351\u031dl\u0335\u035b\u034ey\u0338\u030c\u032e \u0337\u035d\u0321n\u0335\u0303\u0345o\u0337\u0352\u0326r\u0336\u033d\u0324m\u0337\u030c\u0327a\u0335\u033d\u033cl\u0336\u0307\u0339 operating system, for all your mistery-solving needs! Browse the web, read their source code and download any resource you find interesting to unveil the secrets within. It's Cicada3301-style puzzle galore!<br><br>WatanOS is a puzzle sandbox game that puts you behind a computer screen, on your own fake Operating System made for cryptic enthusiasts. Explore the web with the sole purpose of trying to figure out all the misteries within it!<br><br>With several &quot;puzzle hubs&quot;, you'll find multiple places to satisfy your puzzle-solving needs.<br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Text encryption? We got you.<br></li><li> Image editing? We got you.<br></li><li> Analyzing fake HTML code to find hidden messages? We got you.<br></li><li> Audio and Video playing tools? We got you.</li></ul><br>Mind-bending puzzles that require outside-the-box thinking? That's what we do, baby!",
